  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Online Bureau\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Nov 19, 2026 at 11:54 AM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>Gurugram: <a href=\"/tag/vituscare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">VitusCare</a>, a <a href=\"/tag/dialysis+care\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">dialysis care</a> provider has raised $3 million in series B funding participated in by Singapore-based <a href=\"/tag/healthcare+growth+equity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">healthcare growth equity</a> firm <a href=\"/tag/liberty+ridge+capital\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Liberty Ridge Capital</a>, HDFC Bank, Equentis, NAFA Capital Advisors, existing investors 1Crowd and 3i Partners, and several angel investors.The network said its revenue increased nearly three times since its last funding round in late 2024, growing from 22 to over 60 dialysis centres across nine states and over 50 cities.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>It has treated more than 35,000 patients and delivered over 8 lakh dialysis sessions.VitusCare runs on a shop-in-shop model bringing specialised dialysis services into existing hospitals. It aims to expand to more than 100 centres by the end of FY27 and is exploring opportunities in select Asian markets.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>The company said it will use the fresh capital to support its next phase of growth, including network expansion, technology development and workforce training, invest in AI-native business modules and establish a technician academy.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Prabhat Shrivastava, Founder &amp; CEO, VitusCare, said, “This fundraise marks an important milestone in VitusCare’s journey. We are focused on building a sustainable dialysis care model that combines clinical excellence with operational efficiency. The confidence our investors have shown in us reinforces our approach to disciplined growth, improving centre-level performance and strengthening our operational foundation. As we expand our network, we remain focused on maintaining consistent care standards while making quality dialysis services more accessible across underserved markets.”</p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Nov 19, 2026 at 11:54 AM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Nov 19, 2026 at 11:54 AM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"/app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download the ETHealthworld App</a> and get the Realtime updates and Save your favourite articles.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                                            <!-- <div class=\"app-store-container desktop-view\">\n                            <a href=\"/app\" title=\"\" aria-label=\"Play Store\">\n                                <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-g-play.png\" alt=\"\" />\n                            </a>\n                            <a href=\"/app\" title=\"App Store\">\n                                <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/the